[
  {"comment": "Pulleys (mitcad#562). Pulley1 F1: GT2 2 mm, 20 teeth, for a 6 mm belt (7 mm toothed with the 1 mm clearance), flanges 18 x 1 on both sides, an 8 mm bore. Outside diameter 40 / pi - 2 x 0.254 = 12.224395. Volume: the toothed section's area 101.994809 (pulley_values' section_area; the outline's arcs and lines) x 7 + 2 x pi 9^2 x 1 (508.938010) - pi 4^2 x 9 (452.389342) = 770.512331."},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "pulley", "kind": "toothed", "profile": "gt2_2mm", "plane": "xy", "teeth": 20,
    "belt_width": 6, "flanges": {"sides": "both", "diameter": 18, "thickness": 1},
    "bore": {"type": "plain", "diameter": 8}, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Pulley1", "status": "ok", "body": "F1.b0", "has_face": "F1:tip(1)"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F1.b0", "has_face": "F1:flange_a"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F1.b0", "has_face": "F1:bore"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F1.b0", "bbox": {"min": [-9, -9, 0], "max": [9, 9, 9]}, "tolerance": 1e-3}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "pulley_values", "uid": "F1"},
    "result": {"teeth": 20, "pitch_diameter": 12.732395447351628, "outside_diameter": 12.224395447351628,
               "tooth_width": 7, "length": 9}}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "pulley_values", "uid": "F1"}, "result": {"section_area": 101.994809}, "tolerance": 1e-5}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F1.b0", "volume": 770.512331, "tolerance": 1e-5}},

  {"comment": "Pulley2 F2: HTD 5M, 30 teeth, for a 15 mm belt (16 mm toothed), a 30 x 10 hub, a 12 mm bore with its DIN 6885 keyway (4 x 1.8, along x). Outside diameter 150 / pi - 2 x 0.5715 = 46.603483; tooth 1 on the x axis (x to 23.301741), the y axis in a groove (y to 23.201328). Volume: the section 1527.176802 x 16 (24434.828832) + pi 15^2 x 10 (7068.583471) - the keyed bore's area (pi 6^2 less the 0.920420 segment the keyway's sides cut off, plus its 4 x 2.143146 rectangle: 120.749498) x 26 (3139.486956) = 28363.925347."},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "pulley", "kind": "toothed", "profile": "htd_5m", "plane": "xy", "center": [100, 0],
    "teeth": 30, "belt_width": 15, "hub": {"diameter": 30, "length": 10},
    "bore": {"type": "plain", "diameter": 12}, "keyway": true, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Pulley2", "status": "ok", "body": "F2.b0", "has_face": "F2:keyway_top"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F2.b0", "has_face": "F2:hub"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F2.b0", "bbox": {"min": [76.698259, -23.201328, 0], "max": [123.301741, 23.201328, 26]}, "tolerance": 1e-3}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "pulley_values", "uid": "F2"},
    "result": {"pitch_diameter": 47.74648292756861, "outside_diameter": 46.60348292756861}}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "pulley_values", "uid": "F2"}, "result": {"section_area": 1527.176802}, "tolerance": 1e-5}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F2.b0", "volume": 28363.925347, "tolerance": 1e-5}},

  {"comment": "Pulley3 F3: F1's pulley with a 5 mm bore, a 16 x 7 hub and two M3 set screws (tap drills of 2.458734, 90 degrees apart) in the hub's middle, 12.5 from the plane. Volume: 713.963663 (the teeth) + 508.938010 (the flanges) + pi 8^2 x 7 (1407.433509) - pi 2.5^2 x 16 (314.159265) - 2 x 26.372274 (each tap drill between the bore and the hub's outside: the integral over its section of sqrt(8^2 - v^2) - sqrt(2.5^2 - v^2)) = 2263.431369."},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "pulley", "kind": "toothed", "profile": "gt2_2mm", "plane": "xy", "center": [200, 0],
