    "hub": {"diameter": 16, "length": 7}, "bore": {"type": "plain", "diameter": 5},
    "set_screws": {"count": 2, "thread": {"designation": "M3x0.5"}}, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Pulley3", "status": "ok", "body": "F3.b0", "has_face": "F3:set_screw(2)"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F3.b0", "bbox": {"min": [191, -9, 0], "max": [209, 9, 16]}, "tolerance": 1e-3}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F3.b0", "volume": 2263.431369, "tolerance": 1e-5}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "threads"}, "result": [{"feature": "F3", "designation": "M3x0.5", "modeled": false},
                                                         {"feature": "F3", "designation": "M3x0.5", "modeled": false}]}},

  {"comment": "Pulley4 F4: GT2 40 teeth on one belt with F1, 80 mm along y. The belt: pitch radii R = 12.732395, r = 6.366198, sin(t) = (R - r) / 80, L = 2 x 80 cos(t) + pi (R + r) + 2 t (R - r) = 159.492590 + 60 + 1.014284 = 220.506874 mm, 110.25 teeth; 9 teeth in mesh on F1 (20 x (pi - 2 t) / 2 pi = 9.49); 220 the nearest catalogue length."},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "pulley", "kind": "toothed", "profile": "gt2_2mm", "teeth": 40, "belt_width": 6,
    "belt_with": {"pulley": "F1", "center_distance": 80, "angle": "90 deg"}, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Pulley4", "status": "ok", "body": "F4.b0"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F4.b0", "bbox": {"min": [-12.478395, 67.521605, 0], "max": [12.478395, 92.478395, 7]}, "tolerance": 1e-3}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "pulley_values", "uid": "F4", "belt_lengths": [200, 220, 240]},
    "result": {"center_distance": 80, "belt_length": 220.5068738, "belt_teeth": 110.2534369, "teeth_in_mesh": 9,
               "catalogue_length": 220, "mate": "F1"}, "tolerance": 1e-6}},

  {"comment": "Seats on shafts (mitcad#578). A shaft: an 8 mm circle at (300, 0) (Sketch1 F5) extruded 30 up z (Extrude1 F6). Pulley5 F7: F1's pulley seated on the shaft's top end edge 2 mm down, facing down the shaft: its plane at z = 28, the pulley from z = 19 to 28; its bore the shaft's 8 mm and a 0.2 mm clearance. Volume: 713.963663 (the teeth) + 508.938010 (the flanges) - pi 4.1^2 x 9 (475.291553) = 747.610120."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_circle", "sketch": "F5", "center": [300, 0], "diameter": 8},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude", "profiles": [{"sketch": "F5", "region": "r{c1}"}],
    "extent": {"type": "distance", "distance": 30}, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Extrude1", "status": "ok", "body": "F6.b0", "has_face": "F6:side(c1)"}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "pulley", "kind": "toothed", "profile": "gt2_2mm", "teeth": 20,
    "belt_width": 6, "flanges": {"sides": "both", "diameter": 18, "thickness": 1},
    "seat": {"shaft": {"body": "F6.b0", "edge": "E{F6:end(r{c1})|F6:side(c1)}"}, "offset": 2},
    "bore_clearance": 0.2, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Pulley5", "status": "ok", "body": "F7.b0", "has_face": "F7:bore"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F7.b0", "bbox": {"min": [291, -9, 19], "max": [309, 9, 28]}, "tolerance": 1e-3}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F7.b0", "volume": 747.610120, "tolerance": 1e-5}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "pulley_values", "uid": "F7"},
    "result": {"bore_diameter": 8.2, "shaft_diameter": 8,
               "seat": {"origin": [300, 0, 28], "axis": [0, 0, -1], "end": [300, 0, 30], "length": 30, "hole": false}},
    "tolerance": 1e-6}},

